# Phase 3 — Customer rating action

Spec items 1, 2 (application-level refusal), 3, 4 and all of their acceptance criteria.

## Context

`src/portal.js` is "what a customer can do from the portal. Every function takes the signed-in customer and reads
only their organisation's tickets" — `getMyTicket` already has the org-scoping pattern this reuses. This phase
depends on phase 1 (`owner_id`) and phase 2 (`insertRating`/`getRating`); do not start it before both are merged.

## Hot-path gate

`rateTicket`'s org check is new tenant-scoping logic (protocol hot-path list), even though it copies an existing
pattern. Recommendation: this phase is otherwise ACT-sized (3 files), but route it through `bk-review` before
`bk-ship` anyway, same as phase 1 — don't skip the gate just because the diff is small.

