# Plan: CSAT rating

Spec: `docs/specs/csat-rating.md` (approved, Mai Do, product, 2026-01-12).

## Goal

Let a customer rate their own organisation's resolved tickets 1–5, notify the owning agent by email on a low
score, publish a weekly per-agent rating summary, and rename `assignee_id` to `owner_id` everywhere (spec item 6).

## Phases

| # | Phase | File | Status | Review gate |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| 1 | Rename `assignee_id` → `owner_id` | `phase-01-rename-owner-id.md` | not started | COUNCIL (schema-shaped rename + external API contract) — independent review before push |
| 2 | Ratings store | `phase-02-ratings-store.md` | not started | COUNCIL (new store shape) — sign off on the shape before phase 3 |
| 3 | Customer rating action | `phase-03-portal-rating.md` | not started | ACT; touches tenant scoping (hot path) — independent review before push |
